--- captures grouped by the match they came from ---
  scope=class A name=A
  instance=def go name=go
--- what those matches declare ---
  scope A 1-4
--- the nodes holding one, outermost first ---
  go: Outer > Inner
  away: Outer
--- what each comment stands next to ---
  0: comment
  10: code
  40: nothing
--- the matches gathered under the declaration each names ---
  2:settle of+positional of+block
  6:settle of+keyword
